    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 10.34,
    "text": "My mother-in-law's niece's daughter, but, um, she's the one that's paying nothing."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_228a86f176f78b246acd",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 10.34,
    "end_time": 11.34,
    "text": "She got in for free."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_30724743e5bff6d171d8",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 11.34,
    "end_time": 26.5,
    "text": "Yeah. She knew she wasn't even accepted. They pushed and pushed and pushed. Her grandfather is Shragomash Akaminovich from Mir, so he called up and got her in."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2b91ae1f5d68a1f805ab",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 27.5,
    "end_time": 30.5,
    "text": "What's doing there?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_66c8558cbfb9735e80b1",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 30.5,
    "end_time": 32.5,
    "text": "Nothing, so I had specimens for today."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_08fd5f8d1e66a309599f",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 32.5,
    "end_time": 33.5,
    "text": "What is it?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_26948fc28ad850ae199f",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 33.5,
    "end_time": 40.5,
    "text": "It was my next-door neighbor, Susan. She moved away. Oh. But, um, she'd taken the girls?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5be25f63882d5f4208d0",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 40.5,
    "end_time": 41.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2017a1ba7d6378e2cf98",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 41.5,
    "end_time": 44.5,
    "text": "She invited Elkinsari and chose you, but I'm just taking Elkinsari."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_b5b7c06f09a692dbc741",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 44.5,
    "end_time": 47.5,
    "text": "Mm-hmm. What'd you get as a gift?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_75f62731c5ceb1b27500",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 47.5,
    "end_time": 52.5,
    "text": "I got her a set of towels, three towels with her name on it."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_e863e899d04bb5a86ab2",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 52.5,
    "end_time": 53.5,
    "text": "Oh, that's nice."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ceef8c52fe0c58f1b16c",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 53.5,
    "end_time": 59.5,
    "text": "Yeah, because they just moved into a new house, and she's her only daughter. She has her own bedroom. She has her own bathroom."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ce9ecca94f578a05ea06",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 59.5,
    "end_time": 60.5,
    "text": "Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0cd3c666c8d91717c26f",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 60.5,
    "end_time": 74.5,
    "text": "So, very nice. Very pretty. It's pink with, you know, like maroon lettering and, you know, green flower underneath. That's great. And that's my big thing today."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_8172084ef44edbb146a2",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 74.5,
    "end_time": 76.5,
    "text": "How's school going?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_e2aa4fc79de3d19329e1",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 76.5,
    "end_time": 78.5,
    "text": "The baby was sick again on Friday."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_83e6cb880960badc2dd1",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 78.5,
    "end_time": 79.5,
    "text": "With what?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ec02a405d81fa5b44b15",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 79.5,
    "end_time": 81.5,
    "text": "She doesn't digest it well."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_32010006da78644a6e1c",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 81.5,
    "end_time": 82.5,
    "text": "So what's going to be?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_e91ff2820a967369c51a",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 82.5,
    "end_time": 85.5,
    "text": "So I'm going to take her to a specialist and then hand Gribbets."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ee8c3d8e1be361fef1d0",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 85.5,
    "end_time": 87.5,
    "text": "I've heard of Gribbets."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_b091606c47d9aba866b7",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 87.5,
    "end_time": 89.5,
    "text": "Yeah, he's a big doctor."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_93d392ea141a548b1f03",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 89.5,
    "end_time": 90.5,
    "text": "Did he get an appointment?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0465d3023bd3c698cb0b",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 90.5,
    "end_time": 100.5,
    "text": "No, my mother-in-law's going to call us today. And, um, do they think that that's what caused it?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_9edb291b5f371cb9764c",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 100.5,
    "end_time": 103.5,
    "text": "That the whole digestive system about awake?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_27c4b6b110ffd414271f",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 103.5,
    "end_time": 120.5,
    "text": "Maybe. But she, I mean, she wasn't sick. You don't see her or anything, but she, um, you know, she was constipated again on Friday. It took me about three hours to get it out. And yesterday again, it's very harsh. I need something that, you know, will soften it."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_19104dc1dc87f4bce550",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 120.5,
    "end_time": 124.5,
    "text": "Wow. Poor kid. Did you have this with somebody else?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_645ac95a8097bec1a584",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 124.5,
    "end_time": 129.5,
    "text": "Yeah, but they, it wasn't as bad. You know, I would just take a thermometer and they would go."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_12a4ea3a6a9e45939416",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 129.5,
    "end_time": 130.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2dffcb167053a2bfd623",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 130.5,
    "end_time": 137.5,
    "text": "I remember somebody was constipated. I'm always constipated. And I spoke to mom last night."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_06727b1e69588504b290",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 137.5,
    "end_time": 138.5,
    "text": "Yeah, what did she say?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_65f3b02a6b6f896bbcb3",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 138.5,
    "end_time": 165.5,
    "text": "Well, I called her because I had sent the package and I didn't know if she got it yet, but she didn't. And I told you all those school things. Oh, yeah. She didn't get it yet. And, um, what did she say? She started to tell me something. Oh, Bakhanan Heidi. What? That, they called her. They wanted her to come for circus. Because Heidi just said that she's going to have to go on Yantzis. Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_63163bbd60f02bc2e328",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 165.5,
    "end_time": 183.5,
    "text": "She's going to have to take her who's going to, you know, be with the kids or whatever. And dad doesn't want to go because he, he feels that it's going to be too hard on mom. But mom said, she said to me, you know, I really feel I should go. You know, they're asking me."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_094ede9e46d4eb0b9a12",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 183.5,
    "end_time": 184.5,
    "text": "They need me."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_717c99cf46257afae0ec",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 184.5,
    "end_time": 191.5,
    "text": "Right. And her mother doesn't know until a week before if she can get off."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_1a405b57be7c63a325e8",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 191.5,
    "end_time": 198.5,
    "text": "So, so mom's going to go."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_dbe9ac5521a3d6f85719",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 200.5,
    "end_time": 202.5,
    "text": "I don't know. I don't know."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_294308c1c84893d46b0e",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 202.5,
    "end_time": 204.5,
    "text": "I don't know. What about her cousin that she's always helping out?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0fbca3a574d1e19fc3ec",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 204.5,
    "end_time": 233.5,
    "text": "Oh, I think Heidi's a total idiot if you ask me. I mean, when we're going to your bar mitzvah, remember? Yeah. So I said to her, why don't you just, you and Bakhanan fly? She was a little bit about the kids. I said, hi, do you took your cousin's kids? We'll find them. Why can't you leave? She wasn't there. And so, why can't you leave the other ones? She said, she's a little very hard time for her now because her husband's starting school. I said, so what? Isn't it always a hard time for everybody?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f9d0abace52ad66a0c86",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 233.5,
    "end_time": 252.5,
    "text": "I don't know. She always takes them happily. And I know her cousin. Heidi would take them. She's got something against asking it. I don't know. So, listen, it's her business, not mine."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2e0220246a24aa54ed8f",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 252.5,
    "end_time": 254.5,
    "text": "So mom doesn't want to go or dad doesn't want to go?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2e7adea324fc2448203f",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 254.5,
    "end_time": 256.5,
    "text": "Dad doesn't want to go."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5b9ab6c6226e7f25f1c3",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 256.5,
    "end_time": 257.5,
    "text": "He never wants to go."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a82e26b3f779c22d346e",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 257.5,
    "end_time": 258.5,
    "text": "I know."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_1313d1a024737367a0c9",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 258.5,
    "end_time": 261.5,
    "text": "It probably will be hard for mom."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ae9c58545bd767853f01",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 261.5,
    "end_time": 287.5,
    "text": "But then I said to mom, I said, well, I'm sure, you know, Heidi, she has everything already and set. You know, so she said, no, she hasn't been feeling so well lately. She's been feeling very happy. I don't think she really has anything prepared. I said, maybe if you, you know, mentioned her to prepare it all. I mean, she's home now all day without anything. The kids have gone from nine to four. I'm sure she's preparing."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6c58a979038619750528",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 287.5,
    "end_time": 289.5,
    "text": "I think so too, but..."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_95f716f2f660240f7c25",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 289.5,
    "end_time": 292.5,
    "text": "Or if she didn't, she's waiting for this week to do it."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ee0ee9644a2b587eee85",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 292.5,
    "end_time": 294.5,
    "text": "I think so too. It's not like her."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_728a9c7545fe76c89140",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 294.5,
    "end_time": 297.5,
    "text": "Yeah, it's not like her. Especially she's leaving mom alone."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_7152fe6c017630482904",
    "conversation_id": "call_002",
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 297.5,
    "end_time": 304.5,
    "text": "She usually doesn't want mom partying around that much. She likes to do her things her way. She likes to do her things her way."
  }
]
